      "text": "Infernum Active: Aphelios spouts a wave of flame, dealing ((20 ~ 110) + ((15% ~ 21%) bonus Attack Damage) + (70% Ability Power)) physical damage. Then he Attacks each enemy hit with his off-hand weapon.",
